  "source_transformations": [
    "Synthetic fixture roots instead of machine roots",
    "OS-selected home and synthetic mailbox in privacy self-tests; sanitizer unchanged",
    "APP32 selects complete checkout through MACRUNNER_ROOT",
    "Base64 image source restored to exact pinned PNG/ICNS bytes",
    "Two Gothic routing integration tests require APP32_ENGINE_ROOT, consistently with the existing complete-engine test suites. Component-only CI reports them skipped; final whole-engine acceptance must enable them. Product sources and the frozen local candidate are unchanged by this test-scope correction.",
